# Every checkout is byte-identical to the repository: no line-ending conversion, ever.
# Windows checkouts default to core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite the scripts CI runs
# (gradlew and src/scripts/*.sh) with CRLF and break them on Linux.
* -text

# Not text at all: no textual diffs or merges either.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.p12 binary
*.onnx binary
*.ts binary
